  "code" : "public int countPrimes(int n) {\n    boolean[] composite = new boolean[Math.max(n, 1)];\n    int count = 0;\n    for (int i = 2; i < n; i++) {\n        if (!composite[i]) {\n            count++;\n            for (int j = i * i; j < n; j += i) {\n                composite[j] = true;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return count;\n}",
